#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:1
msgid ""
"Do your first steps with Kdenlive video editor, using sigmoidal transfer "
"effect"
msgstr ""
"Dá os primeiros pasos co editor de vídeo Kdenlive co efecto de transferencia "
"sigmoide."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, video editor, help, learn, easy, effects, filter, video "
"effects, stylize, sigmoidal transfer"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, editor de vídeo, axuda, aprender, fácil, efectos, filtro, "
"efectos de vídeo, estilizar, transferencia sigmoide"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:18
msgid "Sigmoidal Transfer"
msgstr "Transferencia sigmoide"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:20
msgid ""
"This effect/filter desaturates the image and creates a particular look that "
"could be called Stamp, Newspaper or Photocopy."
msgstr ""
"Este efecto ou filtro reduce a saturación da imaxe e crea unha aparencia "
"particular que poderiamos denominar de selo, xornal ou fotocopia."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:22
msgid "The effect has keyframes."
msgstr "O efecto ten fotogramas clave."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:30
msgid "Sigmoidal Transfer effect"
msgstr "Efecto de transferencia sigmoide"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:32
msgid "**Brightness** - Controls brightness of image. Range 0 to 100."
msgstr "**Brillo**: controla o brillo da imaxe. Intervalo do 0 ao 100."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/sigmoidal_transfer.rst:34
msgid "**Sharpness** - Controls sharpness of transfer. Range 0 to 100."
msgstr "**Nitidez**: controla a nitidez da imaxe. Intervalo do 0 ao 100."
